  "modmenu.descriptionTranslation.neo": "A modpack for building your ideal Minecraft world.\n\n- World Map (M key): auto-records structures and banners, pins, teleport\n- Zoom: hold right-click with empty hands\n- Free Look: hold F5 to look around\n- Move while inventory is open\n- Switch directly between Advancements and inventory (E / L)\n- 3D skin layers\n- Larger advancements screen\n- Skip click confirmations (commands & links)\n- AFK cinematic camera after 30 seconds idle\n- Enchantment effect tooltips / Spawner info (off by default)\n\nOpen the settings with the @ key, or the icon on the title / game menu.",
